    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061128.0469\n\nBEIJING, Nov. 29 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nURGENT: RMB breaks 7.84 mark against U.S. dollar\n\n\n\n\nThe value of the Renminbi (RMB) against the U.S. dollar hit a new high on Wednesday, with the central parity rate at 7.8394 yuan to one dollar, breaking the 7.84 mark.\n\nThis signifies RMB value has risen by 5.32 percent after China's reform of the exchange rate system on July 21, 2005.",
